      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Is there a toilet here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安：不好意思，请问这里有洗手间吗？",
      "traditional": "安：不好意思，請問這裡有洗手間嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān bù hǎo yì si qǐng wèn zhè lǐ yǒu xǐ shǒu jiān ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: Excuse me, is there a toilet here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李现：有。二楼有男洗手间，三楼有女洗手间。",
      "traditional": "李現：有。二樓有男洗手間，三樓有女洗手間。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ xiàn yǒu èr lóu yǒu nán xǐ shǒu jiān sān lóu yǒu nǚ xǐ shǒu jiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Xian: Yes. On the second floor is the men’s toilet, and on the third floor is the women’s toilet."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安：请问这里是几楼？",
      "traditional": "安：請問這裡是幾樓？",
      "pinyin": "ān qǐng wèn zhè lǐ shì jǐ lóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: What floor are we on now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李现：这里是二楼。",
      "traditional": "李現：這裡是二樓。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ xiàn zhè lǐ shì èr lóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Xian: This is the second floor."
    },
    {
